   "subject": "Re: Increasing size of labels",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hi Tony, just add the following<div><br></div><div>#to save some of the rewriting</div><div>size20 &lt;- theme_text(size=20) </div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">l1+l2+l3+l4+scale_colour_manual(&quot;Year&quot;, c(&quot;2004&quot;=&quot;orange&quot;, &quot;2007&quot;=&quot;green&quot;)) + </span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">  opts(axis.text.y = size20, axis.text.x = size20, axis.title.y = size20, axis.title.x = size20,</span></div><div>  legend.text = size20)</div><div><br></div>\r\n<div>That&#39;s an example, you could change the size with any value that works for you. Also, you could write: </div><div><br></div><div>opts(axis.title.x = theme_text( size = 30))</div><div><br></div><div>again change the size for the one that works for you. </div>\r\n<div>If you are using that size a lot you could save to a theme so you save a lot of time</div><div>I don&#39;t know if there&#39;s any easier solution to this. </div><div><br></div><div>I hope it helps.</div><div>Bye</div>\r\n<div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2009/8/19 Tony Meissner <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tandj.m...@bigpond.com</a>&gt;</span></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial\">I would like to be able to increase the size of the\r\nx-axis and y-axis labels (both the title of the axis and the numbers along the\r\naxis) as well as the size of the legend.  I have looked at the book pdf\r\nand other examples but it is not clear how it is done.  Can you point me\r\nin the right direction?  I enclose code of what I am trying to do, but I\r\nam not sure what extra piece of code I need to do this.  Appreciate any\r\nhelp you can give.</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial\"> </span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial\">l1 &lt;- qplot(irr,dp, data=Pike04[Pike04$crop==&#39;Nuts&#39;,],\r\ncolour=I(&quot;orange&quot;), xlab=&quot;Sum of Applied Irrigation for season(ML/Ha)&quot;,\r\nylab=&quot;Sum of Drainage for season (ML/Ha)&quot;)</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial\">l2 &lt;- geom_point(colour=I(&quot;green&quot;), data=Pike07[Pike07$crop==&#39;Nuts&#39;,])</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial\">l3 &lt;- geom_line(data=grid04, aes(colour=&quot;2004&quot;))</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial\">l4 &lt;- geom_line(data=grid07, aes(colour=&quot;2007&quot;))</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial\">l1+l2+l3+l4+scale_colour_manual(&quot;Year&quot;, c(&quot;2004&quot;=&quot;orange&quot;,\r\n&quot;2007&quot;=&quot;green&quot;))</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial\"> </span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"4\" color=\"blue\" face=\"Calligraph421 BT\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calligraph421 BT&quot;;color:blue\">Tony\r\nMeissner</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"4\" color=\"blue\" face=\"Calligraph421 BT\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calligraph421 BT&quot;;color:blue\">Laroona\r\nEnvironmetrics</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"4\" color=\"blue\" face=\"Calligraph421 BT\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calligraph421 BT&quot;;color:blue\">Tel:\r\n08 8587 6248</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"4\" color=\"blue\" face=\"Calligraph421 BT\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calligraph421 BT&quot;;color:blue\">Mob:\r\n0401 124 971</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"4\" color=\"blue\" face=\"Calligraph421 BT\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calligraph421 BT&quot;;color:blue\">Email:\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tandj.m...@bigpond.com</a></span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"4\" color=\"blue\" face=\"Calligraph421 BT\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calligraph421 BT&quot;;color:blue\">PO\r\n  Box</span></font><font size=\"4\" color=\"blue\" face=\"Calligraph421 BT\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calligraph421 BT&quot;;color:blue\">\r\n 1102</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"4\" color=\"blue\" face=\"Calligraph421 BT\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calligraph421 BT&quot;;color:blue\">Loxton\r\nSA 5333</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p><font size=\"4\